title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf log undo
catalog: CLI command
target: mf log undo
summary: Undo a label of your newest change still standing (none named: list them)

!! Reference

```
Undo a label of your newest change still standing (none named: list them)

Usage: mf log undo [OPTIONS] [ARGS]...

Arguments:
  [ARGS]...
          [plan] [LABEL]: "plan" previews; without a label, the candidates are listed

Options:
      --metadata-only
          Leave out the operations needing a filesystem action

      --on-move-available <ON_MOVE_AVAILABLE>
          Policy when the file is present: apply|skip|abort|ask (default apply)

      --on-move-unavailable <ON_MOVE_UNAVAILABLE>
          Policy when the file is missing: apply|skip|abort|ask (default ask)

      --force
          Skip the confirmation prompt

      --silent
          Suppress informational output

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
